Acknowledgements / attribution
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Seedling is an independent implementation. Two of its components were inspired
by the published work below. No source code from those projects is used here;
only their conceptual approaches informed the design.

* SemRank — conceptual / hybrid reranking approach.
  Zhan et al. — https://github.com/yzhan238/SemRank
  (inspires src/retrieval/relevance_scorer.py)

* ResearchAgent — iterative, multi-agent reviewing pattern.
  Baek et al. — https://github.com/JinheonBaek/ResearchAgent
  (inspires src/retrieval/reviewer_agent.py)
